{"repositoryId":1054892357,"availability":"available","full":"Ujjwaljain16/CampusSync","name":"CampusSync","description":"Next-Generation SaaS for Automated Certificate Management, Verification & Verifiable Credentials","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2025-09-11T13:26:39Z","updated":"2026-10-15T11:10:46Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://campusync1.vercel.app/","topics":[],"demo":"https://campusync1.vercel.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T11:20:36.068Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T11:20:36.068Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T11:20:36.068Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-15T11:20:36.068Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Next-Generation Multi-Tenant SaaS for Seamless Campus Recruitment and Credential Verification","CampusSync is a multi-tenant SaaS platform (under active development; see Security notes & known limitations) designed specifically for universities, educational institutions, and recruiters. It enables streamlined certificate verification and credential management using Gemini Vision based extraction and issues credentials modelled on the W3C Verifiable Credentials data model (JWS-signed, with a did:web issuer and a public key set at /.well-known/jwks.json). The platform supports multi-organization workflows with dedicated dashboards for recruiters, faculty, and administrative users. Built…"],"features":["Data Isolation: organizationid filtering in API queries, backed by RLS in Supabase (see the RLS matrix in DATABASE-SCHEMA.md)","Org Admin Controls: Primary admin designation, role delegation, member management","Recruiter Access Model: Cross-org recruitment: one approved userroles row per organization the recruiter may access","Gemini Vision Extraction: Uploaded certificate images/PDFs are sent to Google Gemini, which returns title, institution, recipient, date and description. Extraction is not guaranteed accurate; a f